  documentId: DOC_DAY1_NEWS
  documentType: 0
  title: "S\u0131cak hava, g\u0131da ta\u015F\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xFCndeme ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131"
  body: "Antalya'da artan s\u0131cakl\u0131klar, g\u0131dan\u0131n \xFCretimden sofraya
    g\xFCvenle ula\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 yeniden g\xFCndeme ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131.
    Yerel s\xFCt \xFCr\xFCnlerinin so\u011Fuk zinciri ve do\u011Fru etiketlenmesi
    dikkatle izleniyor.\n\nK\u0131y\u0131daki g\xF6n\xFCll\xFCler ise caretta carettalar\u0131n
    yuvalama alanlar\u0131nda plastik at\u0131k topluyor. Daha az at\u0131k, hem
    deniz ya\u015Fam\u0131 hem de sa\u011Fl\u0131kl\u0131 g\u0131da i\xE7in ortak
    bir ad\u0131m.\n\nCOP31 haz\u0131rl\u0131k g\xFCnleri / Kurmaca yerel haber"
  taskInstructionBox: "Bug\xFCn SKT'yi ve \xFCr\xFCn\xFCn \xF6n y\xFCz\xFCndeki iddiay\u0131
    arka etiketindeki t\xFCr/i\xE7erikle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r."
  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 889b827d7b7920b4ca7f528f529f112f, type: 3}
  relatedRuleIds:
  - R_EXPIRY
  - R_IDENTITY
  requiresExplicitAcknowledge: 1
